# Cross-Skill Contract — init-council ↔ run-council

> Canonical WRITE↔READ contract for `council.yaml`. Any field written by `init-council` and read by
> `run-council` MUST be registered here. Purpose: prevent writer/reader drift when new fields are added.
>
> Writer: `skills/council/init-council` — produces `.sxtn/council.yaml`
> Reader: `skills/council/run-council` — consumes `.sxtn/council.yaml` at dispatch time
> Schema authority: `schemas/council.schema.json`

---

## How to use this document

1. **Adding a field to init-council output?** Add a row in the table below before committing.
2. **Adding a read in run-council?** Verify the row already exists; if not, add it.
3. **Removing a field?** Mark `status` → `deprecated`, set `removed_at`, open an ADR.
4. Fill `{{PLACEHOLDER}}` values at fill-time — do NOT improvise outside the shape defined here.

