## Drift prevention checklist

Before merging any PR that touches `init-council` output shape or `run-council` dispatch logic:

- [ ] All new output fields added to the contract table above
- [ ] `updated_at` frontmatter bumped
- [ ] `contract_version` incremented if any field changes reader semantics
- [ ] Schema updated in `schemas/council.schema.json` if field must be validated
- [ ] ADR registered in `docs/decisions/0000-decision-log.md` if shape is breaking

